# Wired SteelSeries Apex Pro Mini (USB 1038:161e): keyboard event stream
# needed for reactive / ripple RGB effects. Linux input only; do not grant
# access to every keyboard or to unrelated devices.
#
# Filename MUST precede systemd's 73-seat-late.rules so that the active
# graphical seat gets a dynamic ACL via TAG+="uaccess".
# Keystroke access is sensitive: only enable this rule if you want the
# active local user to be able to read these Mini event devices.
ACTION!="remove", SUBSYSTEM=="input", KERNEL=="event*", ATTRS{idVendor}=="1038", ATTRS{idProduct}=="161e", ENV{ID_INPUT_KEYBOARD}=="1", MODE="0660", TAG+="uaccess"
